{"id":"cristal","lemma":"cristal","pos":"noun","rank":1798,"glosses":["crystal","glass, glassware","window pane"],"ipa":"/kɾisˈtal/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cristales"},"order":1840,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cristal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo un ojo de cristal.","en":"I have a glass eye.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35304","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"eye"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Este cristal es muy caro, al parecer.","en":"This crystal is very expensive, apparently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/857870","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"dear"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"seemingly, apparently"]]},{"text":"La conclusión es clara como el cristal.","en":"The conclusion is crystal clear.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"conclusion, end"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the white"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}